# ====================================================================
# Batas AI Master Workspace GitIgnore
# ====================================================================

# --- System & OS Overheads ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# --- Node.js Dependencies (Frontend & Backend Packages) ---
**/node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Environment Configurations (API Keys & Database Credentials) ---
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# --- Production Builds ---
**/dist/
**/build/
.out/

# --- Python Engine Virtual Environments & Caching ---
**/venv/
**/.venv/
ENV/
env/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
**/.pytest_cache/

# --- Local Databases & RAG Vector Indices ---
# We block the local binary indexing folder since it's rebuilt from raw source documents
**/ai_service/batas_index/

# --- Temporary/User Document Assets ---
# Blocks uploaded test pdf files from cluttering your repository storage limits
**/ai_service/ordinances/*.pdf